#: ../../tools/cellmarker_tools.rst:32 4da97d33e4324e309e1811e4c589d303
msgid ""
"**Description**: List available cell types in the CellMarker 2.0 database"
" for a given tissue and species. Returns all annotated cell types found "
"in that tissue context. Use this to explore what cell types have been "
"characterized in a specific tissue, or to get an overview of CellMarker's"
" coverage. Supports both normal and cancer cell contexts."
