#: ../../tools/cellmarker_tools.rst:72 d830610aca1e4f719f3ca8436038492f
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the CellMarker 2.0 database for marker genes of a"
" specific cell type. Returns curated lists of marker genes that define a "
"cell type, sourced from single-cell RNA-seq studies and experimental "
"literature. Use this to find canonical markers for cell type annotation, "
"or to build gene sets for cell scoring. Example: 'T cell' returns CD3D, "
"CD3E, CD3G, etc. 'Macrophage' returns CD68, CD163, MARCO, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/cellmarker_tools.rst:79 ad158a8f4f654b29b0b95596c1dd0099
msgid ""
