#: ../../tools/cellmarker_tools.rst:113 8c65cf80521e4f10b52b8898d05eb8d3
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the CellMarker 2.0 database for cell types that "
"express a given marker gene. Returns curated cell type annotations from "
"single-cell RNA-seq studies and experimental literature. CellMarker 2.0 "
"covers >500 cell types across >400 tissue types in human and mouse. Use "
"this to identify which cell types a gene marks, enabling cell type "
"annotation in scRNA-seq analysis. Example: CD3D marks T cells, CD68 marks"
" macrophages, EPCAM marks epithelial cells."
msgstr ""

