#: ../../tools/cellmarker_tools.rst:154 8f845fd3a96647c48b34261054d7fbdf
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search the CellMarker 2.0 database for cancer-specific "
"cell markers. Returns marker genes and cell types found in cancer tissue "
"contexts. Use this to identify tumor-specific markers, immune cell "
"markers in the tumor microenvironment, or cancer stem cell markers. "
"Filters results to 'Cancer cell' annotations only. At least one search "
"parameter is required: cancer\\_type (tissue), gene\\_symbol, or "
"cell\\_type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/cellmarker_tools.rst:161 02897b7df199423a8901562edf909411
msgid ""
